  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Dune Allen Luxury Beach Retreat<br><br>Step into your ultimate coastal escape at this stunning Dune Allen Beach home, where luxury meets relaxation. Perfect for large families or group getaways, this expansive property features a resort-style pool deck with optional heated pool and spa, multiple living areas, a game room, and outdoor amenities designed for entertaining or unwinding. Just a 1-minute walk brings you to the beach with convenient parking and services, making it effortless to enjoy sun, sand, and surf.<br><br>This home offers an open floor plan that seamlessly connects indoor and outdoor spaces, with four distinct living areas, a chef's kitchen with top-of-the-line appliances, and three balconies with luxurious seating. The summer kitchen, poolside lounge with Smart TV, fire pit, and putting green create the perfect environment for both relaxation and entertainment. A private elevator ensures convenience on all levels.<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements<br>1st Floor:<br>- Bunk Suite 1 (Sleeps 8): 2 Twin-over-Queen bunks & 1 Twin-over-Twin bunk, Smart TV, closet, en suite with double vanity, walk-in shower, rain and handheld shower heads<br>- King Suite 1 (Sleeps 4): 2 Twin-over-King bunks, Smart TV, closet, en suite with double vanity, soaking tub, walk-in shower, rain and handheld shower heads<br>- Optional Sleeping (Sleeps 2): Inflatable Queen EZ bed with linens<br><br>2nd Floor:<br>- King Suite 1 (Sleeps 2): King bed, Smart TV, closet, balcony access, en suite with double vanity, walk-in shower, dual rain shower heads<br><br>3rd Floor:<br>- King Suite 2 (Sleeps 2): King bed, Smart TV, closet, balcony access, en suite with double vanity, soaking tub, walk-in shower, rain and handheld shower heads<br>- King Suite 3 (Sleeps 2): King bed, Smart TV, closet, balcony access, en suite with double vanity, soaking tub, walk-in shower, dual rain shower heads<br><br>Carriage House:<br>- King Suite 4 (Sleeps 2): King bed, Smart TV, en suite with vanity sink, walk-in shower, rain and handheld shower heads<br><br>Amenities & Features<br>- Private Pool & Spa (optional heating Oct–Apr)<br>- 3 Balconies with luxury seating<br>- 4 Living Room Areas<br>- Game Room: Pool & Ping Pong Table<br>- Fire Pit for evening gatherings<br>- Private Elevator<br>- Putting Green<br>- Summer Kitchen: Built-in gas grill, mini-fridge, dining area<br>- Outdoor Shower<br><br>Important Things to Know<br>- Parking: Up to 4 cars on property<br>- Beach Access: Public Dune Allen Beach – 1-minute walk with parking & services<br>- Pool & Spa: Private; optional heating available Oct–Apr ($70 per night)<br>- Bikes & Golf Cart: 6 bikes + 6-seater golf cart included<br>- Beach Gear: 9 chairs, 3 umbrellas, 22 towels<br>- Baby Gear: Crib, Pack n' Play, and high chair available for rental through Live The Gulf Coast<br>- Pets: Allowed with a $250 non-refundable fee per pet (maximum 2 pets under 50 lbs; breed restrictions apply). No cats.<br><br>Restricted Breeds:<br>Akita, Australian Blue Heeler, Boxer, Bull Mastiffs, Chow, Dalmatian, Doberman, English Bulldog, German Shepherd, Great Dane, Husky (any type), Malamute, Mastiff (any variation), Pit Bulls, Presa Canarios, Rottweiler, Saint Bernard, Wolf-dog Hybrid.<br><br>Booking Information<br>- Check-in: 4:00 PM<br>- Check-out: 10:00 AM<br>- Events: Not permitted unless pre-approved<br>- Age Requirement: Minimum age of 25 for non-family groups<br>- Cancellation Policy: No refunds<br>- Mid-stay Clean Fee: Applies to reservations of 21+ days<br><br>For pool heat, bike rentals, baby gear, beach services, bonfires, excursions, and concierge experiences, please contact Live The Gulf Coast.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Crown of 30A – Pool, Pets & Golf Cart"
        }
      ],
