        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Our family had the most incredible stay at Crown of 30A! This beautifully decorated 3-story home had everything we could possibly need — and more. The layout was perfect for a large group, with plenty of space for everyone to spread out and relax.The kids absolutely loved the bunk room and the game room, while the adults enjoyed relaxing by the private pool and gathering in the spacious common areas. Every detail was thoughtfully designed, from the stylish decor to the well-stocked kitchen. It felt luxurious yet comfortable — truly a home away from home.The location was ideal too — close to the beach, shops, and restaurants, but tucked away enough to enjoy peace and quiet when we wanted it.We’ve stayed in many vacation rentals over the years, and Crown of 30A is by far one of the best. We made so many amazing memories here and can’t wait to come back!",
